--- disclosed harness/test bugs (no app changes resulted) ---
H1 harness minted FRESH locally at tv=3 while row was tv=2 (wrong comment assumption). Effect: every app request with FRESH 401'd and apiFetch correctly cleared it (fresh-survives=0, 1 trapped removeItem from app bundle). Fixed: wrapper asserts row tv==2 post-pre-bump, mints stale=1/fresh=2.
H2 login page consumes ?session=expired on mount (sets message, router.replace("/login") strips param). Effect: toHaveURL(/login?session=expired) was racy (2 flaky passes, 1 bare-/login fail). Not an app bug. Fixed: test records framenavigated history, asserts param-seen + message + cleared storage.
H3 shared-disposable ordering: test 1 green moves row v2->v3, revoking wrapper-minted FRESH(tv=2) for test 3 (proven both directions). Fixed: test 3 mints a live token at test time via /auth/login (tries NEW_PW then PW1), order-independent.
H4 settings button gate was backwards (button enables only after all 3 fields filled); fixed fill-first-then-gate. Plus onboarding-skip init flag (fresh disposables lack faculty/year -> /bienvenue bounce) and networkidle before login fill (pre-hydration click no-op flake).

